{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1583712000, "end_date": 1584316799, "month_true_total": 2704, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:20:55 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "65117880", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962881724", "personaname": "Urbanski", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197962881724/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 28643, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3136, "last_played": 1755209874, "avatar": "f2bdfc73ab7b3374696e4ec1dca566901834d2f0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Picked it up in the sale...feels like I got a real bargain. Solid co-op game with tonnes of charm and humour. Moments of calm before the frequent storms. Really shines when played in a team that know how to work together and communicate. Devs seem like a genuinely nice bunch who are passionate about their game. Rock and stone brother...rock and stone!", "timestamp_created": 1584316613, "timestamp_updated": 1584316613, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "65117476", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026009103", "personaname": "「カイコ」", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yikitama/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 14091, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3066, "last_played": 1761529789, "avatar": "40be84e366b6a3cbbddbd91d5fe84ec3bb7871d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lots of content, tight and intuitive controls, satisfying gunplay, combat, and traversal, and an overall rewarding gameplay loop. Best enjoyed with friends, but fun enough alone too.\nAddendum: New mission types (as of the roughnecks at work update) are a blast, and the overclocks (added since I first reviewed) introduce even more variety to potential playstyles and add fresh incentive to grind, experiment, and synergize with your buddies.\nThe game just keeps getting better, and the devs don't show signs of curbing that trend anytime soon.", "timestamp_created": 1584315885, "timestamp_updated": 1606192467, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "65117388", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030089741", "personaname": "Gaaravan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198030089741/", "num_games_owned": 488, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 13302, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 452, "last_played": 1763444446, "avatar": "29c6450b1abfa5181a6beb6cef1081d03e23a109"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its a fun solo / multiplayer game\nfunny\nmindless", "timestamp_created": 1584315730, "timestamp_updated": 1584315730, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "65116240", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073634887", "personaname": "Garry Phoenix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073634887/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2411, "last_played": 1722658808, "avatar": "7c40